You will see a lot of sweet sauces like this general sauce chicken is a very, very sweet sauce.

240
00:13:11,780 --> 00:13:15,020
You'll also see a lot of soy sauce in American Chinese cooking.

241
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:23,180
And so these are flavors that are very, very strong and they're not the same as the Chinese peppers and these spicy foods you get in China.

242
00:13:23,180 --> 00:13:23,330
That's right.

243
00:13:24,180 --> 00:13:29,590
And actually there's one more dish that we didn't mention in the dialogue actually, but is very famous all around the United States.

244
00:13:29,820 --> 00:13:31,660
It's called chop suey.

245
00:13:31,660 --> 00:13:32,660
Chop suey.

246
00:13:32,660 --> 00:13:35,740
And many people have argued about where the name comes from.

247
00:13:36,900 --> 00:13:40,940
But chop suey is just basically like everything chopped up and fried together, right?

248
00:13:40,940 --> 00:13:43,160
It's like stir fried vegetables and meat.

249
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:46,440
And all put together in just a bowl.

250
00:13:46,940 --> 00:13:47,940
Yeah.

251
00:13:47,940 --> 00:13:52,750
Well, my favorite thing about the American Chinese food that we get is that we get it in these little boxes.

252
00:13:53,130 --> 00:13:53,730
They're very cute.

253
00:13:54,010 --> 00:13:56,550
And you take them home and you open them up and every food has a box.

254
00:13:57,030 --> 00:14:00,890
And then at the end, you also get a fortune cookie, which is a very small cookie.

255
00:14:01,350 --> 00:14:02,870
And inside there's a piece of paper.

256
00:14:03,290 --> 00:14:04,110
So don't eat the paper.

257
00:14:04,850 --> 00:14:06,370
And the paper has a fortune for you.

258
00:14:06,500 --> 00:14:08,740
It says, you will be very lucky today.

259
00:14:08,740 --> 00:14:10,850
Or your favorite number is 17.

260
00:14:12,060 --> 00:14:13,060
And they're very cute.

261
00:14:13,060 --> 00:14:17,860
Actually, you can see these boxes that Catherine mentions on our lesson page.

262
00:14:17,860 --> 00:14:18,610
It's the lesson photo.

263
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:21,260
And as you said, very, very common.

264
00:14:21,260 --> 00:14:22,590
Each dish is put in this little box.

265
00:14:22,980 --> 00:14:28,850
So if you ever get Chinese food, you'll see people carrying these little boxes around because they're very convenient and easy to carry.

266
00:14:29,450 --> 00:14:32,110
But the fortune cookie thing is also very common.

267
00:14:32,350 --> 00:14:35,350
I was actually very surprised when I went to China and there were no fortune cookies.

268
00:14:35,550 --> 00:14:36,410
It's weird, isn't it?

269
00:14:36,590 --> 00:14:39,770
I think it's funny because we expect these things to be very Chinese.

270
00:14:40,110 --> 00:14:43,230
But in fact, when you come to mainland China, they don't have fortune cookies.

271
00:14:43,660 --> 00:14:47,900
So I think it's a nice surprise but also kind of confusing.

272
00:14:47,900 --> 00:14:48,070
That's right.

273
